    "description": "River discharge time series at 2 ungauged locations in the Torne river basin, produced by DGFI-TUM for EO4FLOOD. The basin-wide Parquet file contains multi-mission discharge estimates identified by name. date records observation timestamps; q is estimated discharge in cubic metres per second, and q_u_lower and q_u_upper are the delivered lower and upper uncertainty bounds in the same units. lon and lat locate each site in geographic degrees. Observations are irregularly sampled. Source comments and per-site provenance are retained; inclusion of a site does not imply that its estimates passed a quality filter.",
